From 3c33a095894fd45713c6ee1ab65605fa28d9c70a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Claude=20=28auditor=C3=ADa=29?= <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:35:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] B-02: require internal key or approved user on
 service-role functions

- shared internalAuth block (INTERNAL_CALL_KEY in body, constant-time) in
  15 jobs/fan-out targets and sendPush; generateDraft drops the x-caller
  bypass; logOutboundMessage requires OUTBOUND_LOG_SECRET header (TPV).
- every internal invoke now carries the key (masterTick jobs, webhook
  fan-out, reparoBridge/pollHelloClient sendPush, processAlerts draft).
- masterTick ignores triggers within 200 s of the last start.
- webhook no longer invokes liveKBCheck (B-13); extractMemory removed.

LOCAL ONLY - not pushed, not deployed (Joney: zero deploys).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PxgHgzYFnbNfMPgtjg9uNk
